# Backend images are built with the repo root as context (so they can copy
# packages/labcore). Send nothing by default, then allow only what's needed.
*
!packages/
!apps/*/backend/

# ...and never send these, even inside the allowed folders
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/keys/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.pytest_cache/
**/tests/
**/*.egg-info/
**/*.md
**/*.log
